      "seed": 1012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1012,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  BM25 keyword search with metadata filters (date, author, source, tags)\n•  Semantic vector search using dense embeddings (Jina v3 / BGE-M3)\n•  Hybrid search: BM25 + vectors fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF)\n•  Cross-encoder reranking as an optional post-retrieval stage\n•  Filter by document type, date range, author, user-defined tags",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  BM25 keyword search with metadata filters (date, author, source, tags)\n•  Semantic vector search using dense embeddings (Jina v3 / BGE-M3)\n•  Hybrid search: BM25 + vectors fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF)\n•  Cross-encoder reranking as an optional post-retrieval stage\n•  Filter by document type, date range, author, user-defined tags",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
