      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Natural language Q&A grounded in retrieved document chunks\n•  Every answer includes inline citations + source metadata\n•  Real-time streaming via Server-Sent Events: POST /ask/stream\n•  Synchronous endpoint for batch / programmatic use: POST /ask",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Natural language Q&A grounded in retrieved document chunks\n•  Every answer includes inline citations + source metadata\n•  Real-time streaming via Server-Sent Events: POST /ask/stream\n•  Synchronous endpoint for batch / programmatic use: POST /ask",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
