      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  LangGraph agent loop: plan → retrieve → (self-)critique → answer\n•  Agent tools: hybrid search, summarize, fetch full doc, optional web search\n•  Query rewriting & decomposition for complex multi-part questions\n•  Multi-hop iterative retrieval for deep reasoning chains",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  LangGraph agent loop: plan → retrieve → (self-)critique → answer\n•  Agent tools: hybrid search, summarize, fetch full doc, optional web search\n•  Query rewriting & decomposition for complex multi-part questions\n•  Multi-hop iterative retrieval for deep reasoning chains",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
