      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Per-user interest profiles, followed authors/topics, reading history\n•  Short-term conversation memory + long-term preference store (Postgres + vectors)\n•  Personalized result ranking — boost chunks matching user profile\n•  Proactive digest notifications for new matching content via Telegram",
