      "originalText": "•  Per-user interest profiles, followed authors/topics, reading history\n•  Short-term conversation memory + long-term preference store (Postgres + vectors)\n•  Personalized result ranking — boost chunks matching user profile\n•  Proactive digest notifications for new matching content via Telegram",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
