      "seed": 2014, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2014,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Horizontal API scaling via Docker replicas\n•  Async worker queue (Celery / RQ) decouples heavy ingestion from API\n•  OpenSearch sharding supports large document corpora\n•  Modular monolith boundaries enable extracting any module to a microservice",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Horizontal API scaling via Docker replicas\n•  Async worker queue (Celery / RQ) decouples heavy ingestion from API\n•  OpenSearch sharding supports large document corpora\n•  Modular monolith boundaries enable extracting any module to a microservice",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
