      "seed": 2018, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2018,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  OAuth2 / JWT authentication enforced on all API endpoints\n•  Per-user API keys with configurable rate limiting\n•  Input validation, sanitization, and PII handling at all system boundaries\n•  Secrets managed via env vars / Docker secrets — zero hardcoded credentials",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  OAuth2 / JWT authentication enforced on all API endpoints\n•  Per-user API keys with configurable rate limiting\n•  Input validation, sanitization, and PII handling at all system boundaries\n•  Secrets managed via env vars / Docker secrets — zero hardcoded credentials",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
