      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  LLM distributed traces + prompt versioning via Langfuse\n•  System metrics (latency, throughput, error rate) via Prometheus + Grafana\n•  Structured JSON logging on every service\n•  RAG eval metrics: faithfulness, answer relevance, context precision/recall\n•  RAG evaluation suite gates every CI/CD deploy",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  LLM distributed traces + prompt versioning via Langfuse\n•  System metrics (latency, throughput, error rate) via Prometheus + Grafana\n•  Structured JSON logging on every service\n•  RAG eval metrics: faithfulness, answer relevance, context precision/recall\n•  RAG evaluation suite gates every CI/CD deploy",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
