      "seed": 2026, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2026,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Module boundaries enforced in CI by import-linter (no internal cross-imports)\n•  All code typed with Pydantic + mypy; linted with Ruff + pre-commit hooks\n•  Versioned DB migrations via Alembic — no manual schema edits ever\n•  GitHub Actions CI: lint -> test -> RAG eval -> build image -> deploy",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Module boundaries enforced in CI by import-linter (no internal cross-imports)\n•  All code typed with Pydantic + mypy; linted with Ruff + pre-commit hooks\n•  Versioned DB migrations via Alembic — no manual schema edits ever\n•  GitHub Actions CI: lint -> test -> RAG eval -> build image -> deploy",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
