      "seed": 2030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2030,
      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1721000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Fully containerized — one docker compose up starts the entire stack\n•  LLMProvider interface: swap Ollama <-> Claude API with one config change\n•  DocumentSource interface: add new source adapters without touching core logic\n•  MinIO mirrors AWS S3 API — cloud migration requires zero code changes",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13, "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Fully containerized — one docker compose up starts the entire stack\n•  LLMProvider interface: swap Ollama <-> Claude API with one config change\n•  DocumentSource interface: add new source adapters without touching core logic\n•  MinIO mirrors AWS S3 API — cloud migration requires zero code changes",
